# Build output and test artifacts. `target/` (not `/target`) also covers a build
# or a screenshot run started from inside a crate directory, which is how
# `cargo test -p <crate>` with a relative `INOX_SCREENSHOT_DIR` used to leave
# `crates/<crate>/target/` behind.
target/

# mdBook output for the documentation site (`docs/book/book/`). The site used to
# carry its own .gitignore for this; the single-repository decision removed
# per-component ignore files, so the root one has to cover it.
/docs/book/book/

.commandcode/

# Local probe artifacts from headless compositor experiments (runtime output, not source).
/.probe-run*/

# Local Iced→QML migration probes (not part of the crate tree)
.probe-qtbridge/

# Local per-agent build trees and CI log scratch (never committed).
/.targets/
/.ci-logs/
